	(text "EXP0 and EXP1 carry HRDB (High ROM disable bar) in a build that uses cartridges:\na cartridge grounds them to take $C000-$FFFF from the ROM. They are free only in\na build that never uses cartridges. EXP2 and EXP3 are always free."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
